00:25:57.070 --> 00:25:58.777
"You didn't make me do what I did.

00:25:58.777 --> 00:26:02.160
"I did that" you know?

00:26:02.160 --> 00:26:06.610
And so now, I just hope that life, like,

00:26:06.610 --> 00:26:07.970
I know life, I don't hope

00:26:07.970 --> 00:26:11.403
because I don't like to use hope like,

00:26:12.460 --> 00:26:14.890
when you moving ahead in life,

00:26:14.890 --> 00:26:17.940
and you're doing positive
shit, positive things happen.

00:26:17.940 --> 00:26:20.750
I mean, you can't go wrong doing right.

00:26:20.750 --> 00:26:23.050
You can't go wrong doing right.

00:26:23.050 --> 00:26:26.640
And, you know, and I
heard about you, Mark.

00:26:26.640 --> 00:26:28.940
So I wanted to come here and tell my story

00:26:28.940 --> 00:26:33.940
